{"schema":"learning-v2-theory.v1","lesson":6,"lang":"es","title":"Lo que hace la gente","sections":[{"num":"01","title":"Qué vas a aprender a decir","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Hasta ahora las frases decían cómo es alguien y dónde está: I am ready, it is here. Ahora vas a contar lo que hace la gente: «trabajo en una farmacia», «cortamos el pasto», «va al trabajo en coche». Son cosas que se repiten: trabajo, costumbres, rutina."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I work in a pharmacy.","translation":"Trabajo en una farmacia.","hi":"work"},{"en":"We mow the lawn.","translation":"Cortamos el pasto.","hi":"mow"},{"en":"He drives to work.","translation":"Va al trabajo en coche.","hi":"drives"},{"en":"She teaches English.","translation":"Ella enseña inglés.","hi":"teaches"}]}]},{"num":"02","title":"Quién + acción","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"En español decimos «trabajo» y ya se sabe que soy yo. En inglés hay que decir quién: I work. Y entre quién y la acción no va am, is ni are: I am work es un error."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"quién","accent":false},{"text":"acción","accent":false},{"text":"qué / dónde / cuándo","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I work in a pharmacy.","translation":"Trabajo en una farmacia.","hi":"work"},{"en":"I bake bread.","translation":"Hago pan.","hi":"bake"},{"en":"You sweep the floor.","translation":"Tú barres el piso.","hi":"sweep"},{"en":"We trim the hedge.","translation":"Podamos el seto.","hi":"trim"},{"en":"They build a wall.","translation":"Construyen un muro.","hi":"build"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"Work in a pharmacy.","right":"I work in a pharmacy."},{"wrong":"I am work in a pharmacy.","right":"I work in a pharmacy."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"binary","kind":"binary","question":"Cuentas dónde trabajas. ¿Cuál es correcta?","optionA":"Work in a pharmacy.","optionB":"I work in a pharmacy.","correct":"B","explain":"En inglés hay que decir I al principio."}}]},{"num":"03","title":"I, you, we, they — la acción como en el diccionario","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"En español cada persona cambia: trabajo, trabajamos, trabajan. En inglés, con I, you, we y they la acción no cambia nunca: work, wash, carry. Es más fácil."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I wash the plates.","translation":"Lavo los platos.","hi":"wash"},{"en":"You carry the trays.","translation":"Tú llevas las charolas.","hi":"carry"},{"en":"We pick pears.","translation":"Recogemos peras.","hi":"pick"},{"en":"They dig in the yard.","translation":"Cavan en el patio.","hi":"dig"},{"en":"We play football in the yard.","translation":"Jugamos futbol en el patio.","hi":"play"},{"en":"I ride a bicycle.","translation":"Ando en bicicleta.","hi":"ride"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"We picks pears.","right":"We pick pears."},{"wrong":"They digs in the yard.","right":"They dig in the yard."}]}]},{"num":"04","title":"He, she, it — al final aparece una s","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Con he, she, it, o con una sola persona — the host, my brother — la acción lleva s: he drives, she waits, the host greets. Es el único cambio, y por eso se olvida tanto: He drive es el error más común de la lección."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"he / she / it / una persona","accent":true},{"text":"acción + s","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"He drives to work.","translation":"Va al trabajo en coche.","hi":"drives"},{"en":"She waits at the bus stop.","translation":"Ella espera en la parada.","hi":"waits"},{"en":"She smiles at the baby.","translation":"Le sonríe al bebé.","hi":"smiles"},{"en":"He tastes the soup.","translation":"Él prueba la sopa.","hi":"tastes"},{"en":"The host greets the guests.","translation":"El anfitrión recibe a los invitados.","hi":"greets"},{"en":"It sleeps on the quilt.","translation":"Duerme sobre la colcha. *(el gato)*","hi":"sleeps"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"He drive to work.","right":"He drives to work."},{"wrong":"Drives to work.","right":"He drives to work."},{"wrong":"I works in a pharmacy.","right":"I work in a pharmacy."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"She","after":"at the bus stop.","options":["wait","waits","is wait"],"answer":"waits","why":"Con she la acción lleva s."}}]},{"num":"05","title":"Cuándo va es","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Si la acción termina en sh, ch, s o x, una s sola no se pronuncia: se añade es y aparece una sílaba más. wash → washes, catch → catches, teach → teaches, fish → fishes, mix → mixes."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"She teaches English.","translation":"Ella enseña inglés.","hi":"teaches"},{"en":"She catches the bus.","translation":"Alcanza el autobús.","hi":"catches"},{"en":"He fishes with a rod.","translation":"Pesca con caña.","hi":"fishes"},{"en":"She washes the saucers.","translation":"Lava los platitos.","hi":"washes"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"She teachs English.","right":"She teaches English."},{"wrong":"He fishs with a rod.","right":"He fishes with a rod."}]}]},{"num":"06","title":"Cuándo y cambia a ies","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Si la acción termina en y y antes hay consonante, la y pasa a ies: study → studies, carry → carries. Si antes de y hay vocal, solo s: play → plays."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"She studies with a tutor.","translation":"Estudia con un tutor.","hi":"studies"},{"en":"My brother carries a bundle.","translation":"Mi hermano carga un bulto.","hi":"carries"},{"en":"He plays football.","translation":"Juega futbol.","hi":"plays"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"She studys with a tutor.","right":"She studies with a tutor."},{"wrong":"He plaies football.","right":"He plays football."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"She","after":"with a tutor.","options":["studys","studies","study"],"answer":"studies","why":"Antes de y hay consonante (d), así que y pasa a ies."}}]},{"num":"07","title":"Es para lo que pasa siempre","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Estas frases hablan del trabajo, las costumbres y lo que se repite: I walk to work — «voy caminando al trabajo» (normalmente, cada día). No hablan de lo que pasa justo ahora, en este momento."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I walk to work.","translation":"Voy caminando al trabajo.","hi":"walk"},{"en":"I cycle to work.","translation":"Voy al trabajo en bici.","hi":"cycle"},{"en":"I exercise at home.","translation":"Hago ejercicio en casa.","hi":"exercise"},{"en":"She lives in a flat.","translation":"Vive en un departamento.","hi":"lives"},{"en":"They sell lamps.","translation":"Venden lámparas.","hi":"sell"}]}]},{"num":"08","title":"Dónde y cuándo — al final","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Dónde y cuándo suelen ir al final: I start at two — «empiezo a las dos», She reads in the armchair — «lee en el sillón». La hora va con at: at two, at five. Ese «a las» es at, no to ni in."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I start at two.","translation":"Empiezo a las dos.","hi":"at"},{"en":"I arrive at five.","translation":"Llego a las cinco.","hi":"at"},{"en":"She leaves at four.","translation":"Sale a las cuatro.","hi":"at"},{"en":"She reads in the armchair.","translation":"Lee en el sillón.","hi":"in"},{"en":"We jog at sunrise.","translation":"Corremos al amanecer.","hi":"at"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I start to two.","right":"I start at two."},{"wrong":"I start in two.","right":"I start at two."}]}]},{"num":"09","title":"Acción o pieza, no las dos","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Si hay una acción, no va la pieza: She cooks. Si no hay acción y dices quién es o cómo es, la pieza sí va, y también el sujeto: She is an artist. Las dos juntas no: She is cooks es un error."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"She is an artist.","translation":"Es pintora.","hi":"is"},{"en":"This artist paints portraits.","translation":"Este artista pinta retratos.","hi":"paints"},{"en":"He is a baker.","translation":"Es panadero.","hi":"is"},{"en":"The tailor repairs uniforms.","translation":"El sastre arregla uniformes.","hi":"repairs"},{"en":"I am a beginner.","translation":"Soy principiante.","hi":"am"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"She is cooks at home.","right":"She cooks at home."},{"wrong":"Is a baker.","right":"He is a baker."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"word_bank","kind":"word_bank","prompt":"Di: «El sastre arregla uniformes».","answer":["The","tailor","repairs","uniforms"],"distractors":["is","repair"]}}]},{"num":"10","title":"Los errores que comete casi todo el mundo","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"Work in a pharmacy.","right":"I work in a pharmacy."},{"wrong":"He drive to work.","right":"He drives to work."},{"wrong":"I works at home.","right":"I work at home."},{"wrong":"She teachs English.","right":"She teaches English."},{"wrong":"She studys with a tutor.","right":"She studies with a tutor."},{"wrong":"She is cooks at home.","right":"She cooks at home."},{"wrong":"I start to two.","right":"I start at two."}]},{"kind":"tip","text":"Tres comprobaciones. ¿Dijiste quién? ¿Hay acción? Entonces sin am, is, are. ¿Es he, she, it o una persona? Añade s."}]},{"num":"11","title":"Qué llevarte a la práctica","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Quién + acción, siempre con quién y sin pieza. I, you, we, they — la acción como en el diccionario. He, she, it — más s, a veces es o ies. Dónde y cuándo al final; la hora con at."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"We pack the bags.","translation":"Empacamos las bolsas.","hi":"pack"},{"en":"He coughs.","translation":"Él tose.","hi":"coughs"},{"en":"She catches the bus.","translation":"Alcanza el autobús.","hi":"catches"},{"en":"She studies with a tutor.","translation":"Estudia con un tutor.","hi":"studies"},{"en":"I arrive at five.","translation":"Llego a las cinco.","hi":"arrive"}]}]}],"sessionSection":{"1":"03","2":"03","3":"03","4":"03","5":"03","6":"03","7":"03","8":"03","9":"08","10":"08","11":"08","12":"08","13":"08","14":"08","15":"08","16":"08","17":"04","18":"04","19":"04","20":"04","21":"04","22":"04","23":"04","24":"04","25":"07","26":"07","27":"07","28":"07","29":"07","30":"07","31":"07","32":"07","33":"06","34":"06","35":"06","36":"06","37":"06","38":"06","39":"06","40":"06","41":"08","42":"08","43":"08","44":"08","45":"08","46":"08","47":"08","48":"08","49":"09","50":"09","51":"09","52":"09","53":"09","54":"09","55":"09","56":"09"}}
